              {
               "type": "SOLID",
               "color": "#000000"
              }
             ],
             "text": {
              "characters": "Some early signs that may indicate panic disorder include:\nFrequent unexpected panic attacks\nConstant fear of another attack\nAvoiding places or situations because of anxiety\nDifficulty sleeping due to worry\nIncreased sensitivity to stress\nTrouble concentrating or relaxing\nRecognizing these signs early can help people seek support before symptoms become more severe.",
              "fontSize": 16.0,
              "font": {
               "family": "Roboto",
